# First Notes on String 4 (repertoire plan: st-first-notes-string-4). An original study with a
# D minor colour: the open string 4 (D), fret 2 (E) with finger 2, fret 3 (F) with finger 3.
# D to E is a whole step (two frets), E to F a half step (one fret); bar 2 turns around the half
# step (E F E), bar 4 around the whole step (E D E). The teacher strums Dm and A7. It ends on D.
